OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 15, arrested after man and
OL,4,Ateen stabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 15-year-old boy has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of assault after two people
OL,8,Fpeople were stabbed.
OL,10,FGreater Manchester Police said a
OL,11,F16-year-old boy and a man, 18, were
OL,12,Fattacked just after 17:30 BST on
OL,13,FTuesday in Whittaker Lane, Prestwich.
OL,15,FTheir injuries were not believed to be
OL,16,F"life threatening or life changing",
OL,17,Fthe force said.
