OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 15, arrested after man and
OL,4,Ateen stabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Supt Gareth Jenkins said: "Violence
OL,7,Fon our streets will not be tolerated,
OL,8,Fand I want to reassure members of the
OL,9,Fpublic that we believe this is an
OL,10,Fisolated incident with no wider threat
OL,11,Fto the public."
